easy-hwp consolidates the original easy-hwp HWPX workflows and the locally
installed claw-hwp engine. Original engine code, documentation, themes, and
vendor license files are retained in plugins/easy-hwp/skills/hwp/scripts/vendor.

The binary reader/renderer uses @rhwp/core by Edward Kim. See the bundled
vendor licenses for applicable terms. Optional kordoc and k-skill-rhwp tools
are referenced, not redistributed; their own licenses apply when installed.

Integration and layout fixes are distributed under this repository's MIT
license. No personal documents, profiles, bot credentials, or recipients are
included in the consolidation.
